part places
  tally 2
  note "Places of household B (L §5.10). jodla takes the mortgage's instalments and jodla_over its overpayments (Bank Jodła, loan 7710-22: the Cis rows' titles tell them apart). The accounts' balances before their first statement are not known: each opens with a hole (an opening reading of ?), and the exports' readings anchor them (records/). The claims and the floren account open empty."

